<node TEXT="triangulation: using multiple research techniques and sources of data to explore the issues from different perspectives. It can include multiple theoretical perspectives, multiple observers, different measures and data gathering tools" ID="ID_776146201" CREATED="1714584199308" MODIFIED="1714584199308" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Mackey2005SecondLanguageResearch.pdf">
