<node TEXT="Procedures and structuring" ID="ID_120610405" CREATED="1714585940199" MODIFIED="1714585946250">
<node TEXT="stages and sources for thematic analysis: 1) collecting; 2) engaging with the data; 3) coding; 4) generating code categories; 6) contextualizing and representing the findings. Always considered in a recursive way (you move back and forth through the phases as needed). Useful summary of the steps in correspondence with various theoretical research frameworks in the next page. [Are there any references to reliability, inter- or intra-rater?]" ID="ID_364685152" CREATED="1714584199051" MODIFIED="1714584199051" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Peel2020BeginnersGuideApplied.pdf">
