</node>
<node TEXT="auxiliary analysis techniques: word searches (sometimes including word counts) and key-word-in-context (KWIC, which takes the co-location of word occurrences into account)" ID="ID_1941304345" CREATED="1714584199678" MODIFIED="1714584199679" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Guest2012AppliedThematicAnalysis.pdf">
