<node TEXT="procedure for word search process: generate list of unique words in corpus (exclude common words with low semantic value: articles, prepositions, etc.), generate a count (digital usually) of each word, combine synonyms into single categories, single out categories that occur frequently and are related to the objectives. This list can be a starting point for building the codebook" ID="ID_1649391304" CREATED="1714584199737" MODIFIED="1714584199737" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Guest2012AppliedThematicAnalysis.pdf">
