</node>
<node TEXT="Code frequency: the most common way to quantify thematic content, count the number of tiems a code was applied to a unit of analysis; they are often also the foundation of more advance data reduction techniques" ID="ID_629440331" CREATED="1714584199842" MODIFIED="1714584199842" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Guest2012AppliedThematicAnalysis.pdf">
