<node TEXT="concurrent design for mixed methods analysis: they conduct analysis for each data set and type separately and integrate them after analysis of each is completed. A good reason for this design is triangulation, when the analyst looks for convergence, divergence, contradiction between the data sets, or simply compares them" ID="ID_1091552645" CREATED="1714584199431" MODIFIED="1714584199431" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Guest2012AppliedThematicAnalysis.pdf">
