<node TEXT="Code tagging" ID="ID_1221363364" CREATED="1714586858771" MODIFIED="1714586863583">
<node TEXT="useful practice of flagging poor quality data (unclear answer, ramblings, etc.) with a generic code such as &quot;Unclear_Data&quot;. Then you can go back later and see if the data is relevant or not and how it fits with other themes and codes" ID="ID_640641355" CREATED="1714584199800" MODIFIED="1714584199800" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Guest2012AppliedThematicAnalysis.pdf">
