</node>
<node TEXT="Not everything noticeable on first pass is relevant; analytic objectives should guide and prioritize which themes to develop. However, relevance is not always apparent on a first read, it&apos;s best to err on the side of caution and tag doubtful data for later review." ID="ID_1405287862" CREATED="1714584199717" MODIFIED="1714584199717" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Guest2012AppliedThematicAnalysis.pdf">
