</node>
<node TEXT="Issue of deeper, less obvious readings of the data: it can uncover valuable insights that are not apparent, but the evidence is more tenuous and may not be sufficient. A possible way it to note more interpretive themes and treat them ([tag them?]) as working hypotheses, waiting for more evidence to surface." ID="ID_892972050" CREATED="1714584200008" MODIFIED="1714584200008" LINK="project://16AA1F3483D6GEWV5A1JJLVG6C22R89VFR4E/../../../articulos/pedagogy/Guest2012AppliedThematicAnalysis.pdf">
